WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
 Maybe I could just have a taste.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.000
 Okay, let me see here.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:41.440
 oh, it's crunchy

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:52.940
 I might get a hairball, but it's worth it

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.760
 it's like, if I got a hairball from your hair

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.960
 it would be like a hairball of love
